// #3051: `get("abc")` instantiates the imported callee's `S` at `String`, so a
// caller declaring `State[Int]` does not cover it. Before the published row
// named its formal by variable, `State[S]` stayed open and matched by base name.
import ./generic_row_formal_dep_ok.vibe { State, get }

fn caller() -> Int with State[Int] {
  get("abc")
}
